# Résidanat catalog scaffold seed — combined raw evidence (2026-10-28)
# Harness: prisma/seed-residanat.ts (tsx). Three runs + one live API read-back.
# Disclosed harness bug in an intermediate draft: a URL "corruption guard"
# replaced `postgresql:/` with `postgresql://` producing `postgresql:///...`
# (empty authority) -> connector fell back to `localhost:5432` ->
# PrismaClientInitializationError "Can't reach database server at localhost".
# Fix: plain documented transform `:5432` -> `:6543` + append `&pgbouncer=true`
# (handoff §34 precedent). Fix found BY this run; rerun clean.

